msgid ""
"My friends brought me to a host club called Stardust for the first time the "
"other day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Oh, yeah?"
msgstr "Ah, sì?"

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Yeah, but some scary gangster types came barging in and started breaking up "
"the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "I wish we'd never gone there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "That's... too bad."
msgstr "Che peccato."

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Yeah... Thankfully, Yuya, the manager, was around to protect me from those "
"thugs! He was so hot!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Skinny guys are fine and all, but big and strong? That's a real man right "
"there!"
msgstr ""

